+++0200292b35390000++++++++rid2+variant+of+the+same+bundle%0A++++0300293539000000++++++++mid-burst+%28Tab+released%29%0A++++010300292b3539...0000+++Bluetooth+%28same+bundle%2C+rid3+inside+a+BT+report%29%0A%0A%28Full+ledger+with+10%2B+timestamped+captures+across+wired%2F2.4G%2FBT%2C+analyses+and%0Asupporting+files%3A+https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fjustaperlhacker%2Fsemico-guard+%E2%80%94+see%0Aanalysis%2Fevidence-ledger.md+and+analysis%2FMASTER-ISSUE.md.%29%0A%0A%23%23+Workaround+attempts+that+did+NOT+hold%0A%0A%2A+app+%22Restore+Factory+Settings%22+%28config+rewrite+through+your+own%0A++%60DeviceDriver.exe%60%2C+device+mapped+as+kb-k600t+%2F+device_type+201%29%3A+the+wedge%0A++state+returned+within+one+hour%3B%0A%2A+the+driver+bundle%27s+own+%60vhidflt.sys%60+filter+and+the+standalone%0A++%60700N%280X3B4F%29defineV9_20230316.exe%60+firmware-update+tool%3A+the+app%27s%0A++%2AFirmware+Update%2A+reports+%22already+running+on+the+latest+version%22%3B%0A%2A+OS-side+USB+power+management+%28disabled+at+the+port+level%29%3A+eliminates+the%0A++OS+as+a+trigger+%E2%80%94+the+fault+is+on+the+keyboard+MCU+side.%0A%0A%23%23+The+workaround+that+DOES+work%0A%0ABecause+the+MCU+reloads+when+its+port+is+reset%2C+my+%60semico-guard%60+tool%0A%28systemd+daemon%2C+attached+as+reference%29+detects+the+ghost-bundle+signature+on%0Araw+hidraw+and+issues+%60USBDEVFS_RESET%60+on+the+offending+port.+Recovery+is%0A~0.2-1.0+s+in+%2A%2Awired%2A%2A+mode.+In+2.4G%2FBluetooth+modes+the+receiver+can+only+be%0Are-synced+%28the+MCU+is+battery+powered%29+and+the+stuck+state+survives+longer.%0A%0A%23%23+My+requests%0A%0A1.+Is+there+a+firmware+update+for+the+K552-KRS+newer+than+the+image+published%0A+++inside+the+1.0.4.6+driver+package+%28defineV9+2023-03-16%29%3F+If+yes%2C+please%0A+++send+the+download+link+of+the+update+tool.%0A2.+Could+you+please+confirm+whether+this+wedge+is+a+known+issue+for+the%0A+++SEMICO+%60keyboard-700%2F704K%60+family+%28device_type+201%29%2C+and+if+a+fixed+build%0A+++exists.%0A3.+If+the+issue+is+confirmed+and+unfixed%2C+I%27d+like+to+open+a+warranty+case%0A+++for+the+replacement+of+the+unit+%E2%80%94+my+receipt+is+available.+I+can+also%0A+++supply+the+full+trace+files+%28usbmon+packet+logs+of+the+flasher%2FISP+session%0A+++and+journals+of+every+wedge+event+with+timestamps%29.%0A%0ASerial+number+%2F+purchase+proof+will+follow+upon+reply.+Thank+you+for+the%0Agreat+hardware+%E2%80%94+this+is+purely+a+firmware-crash+report+and+I+am+happy+to+work%0Awith+your+engineering+team+to+nail+it+down+%28forum+thread+cross-links+and+a%0Apublic+repository+with+the+reproducible+logs+are+ready%29.%0A%0ABest+regards%2C%0A%3Cyour+name%3E%0A%3Ccountry%2Ftimezone%3E%0A%3Cyour+support+email%3E%0A